		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">12</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following is what I came up with.
1. Read n
2. Initialize numSpaces as (n-1)
3. Initialize numStars as 1
4. Repeat the below steps (5.1 to 5.6) for n times
5.1. Initialize patLine to be an empty string
5.2. Run a loop for numSpaces iterations, in each iteration add 1 space to patLine
5.3. Run a loop for numStars iterations, in each iteration add 1 star to patLine
5.4. Print patLine
5.5. Decrement numSpaces by 1
5.6. Increment numStars by 2
6. Set numSpaces to 1
7. Set numStars to 2*n-3
8. Repeat the below steps (9.1 to 9.6) for (n-1) times
9.1. Initialize patLine to be an empty string
9.2. Run a loop for numSpaces iterations, in each iteration add 1 space to patLine
9.3. Run a loop for numStars iterations, in each iteration add 1 star to patLine
9.4. Print patLine
9.5. Increment numSpaces by 1
9.6. Decrement numStars by 2</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">645.0789682539682</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">5179.662318707097</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">385.1657168341827</attribute>
				<attribute key="h" type="double">386.18500494321995</attribute>
				<attribute key="type" type="String">rectangle</attribute>
				<attribute key="raisedBorder" type="boolean">false</attribute>
				<attribute key="fill" type="String">#FFCC00</attribute>
				<attribute key="outline" type="String">#000000</attribute>
			</section>
			<section name="LabelGraphics">
				<attribute key="text" type="String">Following is what I came up with.
1. Read n
2. Initialize numSpaces as (n-1)
3. Initialize numStars as 1
4. Repeat the below steps (5.1 to 5.6) for n times
5.1. Initialize patLine to be an empty string
5.2. Run a loop for numSpaces iterations, in each iteration add 1 space to patLine
5.3. Run a loop for numStars iterations, in each iteration add 1 star to patLine
5.4. Print patLine
5.5. Decrement numSpaces by 1
5.6. Increment numStars by 2
6. Set numSpaces to 1
7. Set numStars to 2*n-3
8. Repeat the below steps (9.1 to 9.6) for (n-1) times
9.1. Initialize patLine to be an empty string
9.2. Run a loop for numSpaces iterations, in each iteration add 1 space to patLine
9.3. Run a loop for numStars iterations, in each iteration add 1 star to patLine
9.4. Print patLine
9.5. Increment numSpaces by 1
9.6. Decrement numStars by 2</attribute>
